<title>BELGIUM: Shipper CMB cons profit 4.4 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Shipper CMB cons profit 4.4 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dry freight	   +  600</p>
<p>    Tankers		 -  650</p>
<p>    Gas		     -   20</p>
<p>    Regular lines	 -   90</p>
<p>    Port activities     +  650</p>
<p>    Insurance	     +  100</p>
<p>    Holding		 +3,790</p>
<p>    Cons net		+4,380</p>
<p>			    1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Net dividend	300 bfr	  100 bfr</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave no comparative figures except for the dividend. CMB said profit without extraordinaries amounted to 1.65 billion francs. Extraordinaries included a capital gain from the sale of its Diamond Offshore stake and a 2.01 billion one-time write-off.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
